two_object_prompts.USER_TEMPLATE:
Vocabulary ({n} words, in order):
{vocab}

Objects: {alias0}, {alias1}
Description:
{description}

Reply with exactly this JSON shape, listing up to four vocabulary words per object that the description explicitly supports (fewer is fine, an empty list if nothing applies):
{{"{alias0}": ["word", "word"], "{alias1}": ["word"]}}

